      "value": "<p>You are a living weapon, honed to perfection through countless battles. Your weapon Strikes deal <strong>+2 additional damage</strong> (total +6 with all mastery tiers) and you retain all prior mastery bonuses. Once per turn when you critically hit with a weapon attack, the target is <strong>Stunned 1</strong>.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Improved Soldier Mastery.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: The extra Strike damage is applied automatically, and a critical hit posts a Stunned 1 reminder.</em></p>"
